<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "RetroHexChat supports IRC-compatible formatting, Markdown, and plain text messages."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Message Format")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Use the IRC, MD, and TXT selector beside the composer to choose how the next message is saved and rendered."
  )}
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "IRC: classic mIRC styles. Bold, italic, underline, reverse and the 16 colors."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "Markdown: headings, bold, italic, strikethrough, code, quotes, lists and links. A preview button shows the result before you send."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_ui", "Plain text: the message is sent exactly as typed, with no styles.")}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_fmt_toolbar}>{dgettext("help_ui", "How to format a message")}</.help_h4>
<ol>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "Click the Formatting Toolbar button beside the message box. A small panel opens."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "At the top of the panel, choose IRC formatting, Markdown formatting or Plain text."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "Place the cursor in the message box, then click a style button or press its shortcut."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_ui", "Type your text and press Enter to send it.")}</li>
</ol>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Press %{key} to close the panel and return to the message box. The formatting toolbar is not shown on the Status tab.",
    key: "Escape"
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Methods")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <strong>{dgettext("help_ui", "Toolbar:")}</strong>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "The formatting toolbar changes with the selected message format."
  )}
</p>
<p><strong>{dgettext("help_ui", "Keyboard Shortcuts:")}</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li><kbd>Ctrl+Shift+B</kbd> {dgettext("help_ui", "Bold")}</li>
  <li><kbd>Ctrl+Shift+Y</kbd> {dgettext("help_ui", "Italic")}</li>
  <li><kbd>Ctrl+Shift+U</kbd> {dgettext("help_ui", "Underline")}</li>
  <li>
    <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+D</kbd> {dgettext("help_ui", "Color. Type a color number right after it.")}
  </li>
  <li>
    <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+V</kbd> {dgettext("help_ui", "Reverse. Swaps the text and background colors.")}
  </li>
  <li><kbd>Ctrl+Shift+X</kbd> {dgettext("help_ui", "Reset all formatting")}</li>
</ul>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "These shortcuts insert IRC control codes at the cursor, so use them with the IRC format. Bold, italic, underline and reverse are switches: press the same shortcut again to turn the style off."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_close}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Strip Formatting")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_ui", "Click the")} <strong>S</strong>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "button in the formatting toolbar to strip all formatting from incoming messages."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "The button is called Strip Formatting. The same switch is in the View menu. It changes only how messages look on your screen. Other people still see the formatting."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Rules and limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "In a channel with mode %{mode}, the server removes all formatting from new messages and saves them as plain text.",
      mode: "+c"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "Only the first 128 IRC formatting codes in a message are shown."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_ui", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="formatting-message-formats">
    {dgettext("help_ui", "Message Formats")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
<p><.help_link topic="formatting-colors">{dgettext("help_ui", "Colors")}</.help_link></p>
<p><.help_link topic="mode-c">{dgettext("help_ui", "Strip Colors")} (+c)</.help_link></p>
